rl.\n\nRed:  cold girl, but she can become passionate. Tsundere-type. \n\nGreen: noble daughter, amateur novelist, no friends.\n\nGold: heroine-type girl, cheat skill character. Gives unconditional love.\n\nBlack: noble daughter, commander girl. Gives conditional love only.\n\nWhite: stoic genius mage. Cares more for self. Star magician.\n\nPink: chaotic shrine maiden. Cares more for others. Rain dancer, rainbow maker.\n\nSilver:  overworked holy sister. Flawless qualities, has bad luck.\n\nPurple: 1st princess “Cattleya”. A gentle but lonely girl. Queen of orchids.\n\nOrange: 2nd princess, “Rosalind”. Younger sister villainous type. Orange rose.\n\nDark-blue: royal maid, retainer, professional shirker.\n\nDark-red: professional assassin, retainer, common-sense girl.\n\nAnything is fine! \n\nThank you for your time!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tg-HEjnr8RJ8h-nrW-Um0YfQxp22FEg7", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@conecone_ch/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d70f5dd/uploads/origins/62d002a3-c5c4-4c53-a4a7-8b42fb0aa0a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3deabb46b11c9e5a80d927a405fd4153", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d70f5dd/uploads/origins/62d002a3-c5c4-4c53-a4a7-8b42fb0aa0a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3deabb46b11c9e5a80d927a405fd4153, https://si.imgix.net/4d70f5dd/uploads/origins/62d002a3-c5c4-4c53-a4a7-8b42fb0aa0a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=47cb226f1c49fa28c92b18d985fda2c3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d70f5dd/uploads/origins/62d002a3-c5c4